  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\mathrm{H}_3 \\mathrm{C}-\\mathrm{CH}_2-\\mathrm{CH}\\left(\\mathrm{CH}_3\\right)-\\mathrm{CH}_3$ on monochlorination gives\n$\\mathrm{H}_2 \\mathrm{C}(\\mathrm{Cl})-\\mathrm{CH}_2-\\mathrm{CH}\\left(\\mathrm{CH}_3\\right)-\\mathrm{CH}_3$\n(I)\nAchiral\n$\\mathrm{H}_3 \\mathrm{C}-\\mathrm{CH}(\\mathrm{Cl})-\\mathrm{CH}\\left(\\mathrm{CH}_3\\right)-\\mathrm{CH}_3$\n(II)\nChiral\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/Lrx8ym_zFZqf92rd-Xa5TofLPcgoxWLI1mi981Zb1Fg.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\n(III)\nAchiral<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/KTXjE5avk2BRbVr4-hOcLHi9kfhtHMV9_718H2Tn9E0.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\n(IV)\nchiral",
